  "evt.religious.ms.dday": "Celebration day ✨",
  "evt.religious.cheer.early": "Saving several months ahead is the one real defence against the price surge before the holiday — you buy while things are still quiet.",
  "evt.religious.cheer.onTrack": "The dedicated savings are coming along nicely: the celebration will be beautiful AND debt-free. That is exactly the spirit.",
